# Bitfinex showcase — full research replica

## Goal

Railway showcase runs the **same behavior** as synced `bybit_bot.py`: CSV/JSONL, replay buffers, exports, full dashboard.

**Do not** re-add Architecture B write gates or `SHOWCASE_EXECUTION_ONLY` trimming — it does not reduce Railway cost (RAM/CPU limits do).

## Keep (Bitfinex-specific only)

- `scripts/patch-btc-bot-production.mjs`: pause/resume, health, credentials guard, showcase balance/history, pathway markers, **relay webhooks** (`_push_showcase_relay_event`)
- `btc_conservative_agent.py`: relay webhook URL + `register_showcase_ui()` (sync APIs only)
- `showcase_ui.py`: `/api/sync_status`, `/api/fresh_start` — **do not** block export/reset routes
- NestJS copy execution unchanged

## Rule of thumb

Signal + research behavior = **identical** to research bot.

Platform-only additions = relay wake, Admin credentials, sync status API.
